	(footprint "lib:ESP32-S3-WROOM-1"
		(layer "F.Cu")
		(uuid "92a720b8-6473-ffc4-7fa8-ef701c075add")
		(at 35 50)
		(descr "ESP32-S3-WROOM-1 module, 18.0 x 25.5 mm body, 39 castellated pads, 1.27 mm pitch. Dimension sourcing: Espressif ESP32-S3-WROOM-1 datasheet v1.5 — confirmed pad pitch (1.27 mm), body dimensions (18.00 x 25.50 mm), pad count (39), pad size (0.90 x 1.70 mm), with 0.90 mm along the package edge (the pitch axis) and 1.70 mm perpendicular to it. 2026-07-29: the 16 left- and 17 right-edge pads had these two dimensions transposed, putting 1.70 mm on a 1.27 mm pitch -- 0.43 mm of solid copper overlap between every adjacent pair. Corrected to (size 1.7 0.9) for the side edges only; the 5 bottom-edge pads step 3.00 mm in X and were already correct. The transposition is geometrically forced, not a judgement call: a 1.70 mm pad cannot sit on a 1.27 mm pitch, so the datasheet dimensions admit exactly one realizable assignment. Medium confidence — pad dimensions are from the datasheet land-pattern recommendation, not verified against a physical part.")
		(tags "espressif esp32-s3 wroom module")
